\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 3. LETTER SPACING - IMPORTANT\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The current website layouts contain excessively wide letter spacing in many places, sometimes reaching values around 240.\
This creates an artificial, generic AI-generated appearance and does not match the intended visual identity of Oblique House.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Reduce letter spacing consistently throughout the entire website.
\f1\b0 \
Maximum permitted letter spacing: 
\f0\b 0.04em
\f1\b0  (equivalent to 40 in a design-software tracking scale based on 1/1000 em).\
Do not use values above 0.04em.\
In most cases, use normal or very subtle letter spacing. Do not automatically apply wide tracking to uppercase text.\
This rule applies to ALL text elements, including:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
