\f1\b0  This instruction concerns LETTER SPACING (spacing between individual characters), not LINE HEIGHT (spacing between lines).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 4. TYPOGRAPHIC CONSISTENCY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Maintain the same typography system across all website pages and sections.\
Do not introduce additional fonts without approval.\
Do not use excessive tracking, unnecessary boldness or artificial spacing.\
Typography should feel elegant, editorial, natural and consistent with the luxury positioning of Oblique House.\
Follow the original visual references when choosing font sizes, weights, alignment and hierarchy.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

