\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 FINAL DESIGN PRIORITY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The website must follow the original designer's typography and visual direction.\
Use Helvetica Neue for functional and readable text, and The Seasons for elegant editorial headings.\
Keep letter spacing subtle and natural throughout the website. Never exceed 0.04em.\
The final result should feel like a carefully art-directed luxury hospitality website, not an AI-generated template.\
